      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Concurrency in C++ 14\nc++ didn't have thread before C++ 11\n\n\nThere are three things. \n\n1. thread creation\n2. thread synchronisation\n3. thread communication \n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Concurrency in C++ 14\nc++ didn't have thread before C++ 11\n\n\nThere are three things. \n\n1. thread creation\n2. thread synchronisation\n3. thread communication \n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
