      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nSimilar to goroutine we have thread in c++ \n\n\n#include<thread>\nusing namespace std;\n\nvoid findOdd(int arg1, int arg2) {}\n\n\n\nsyntax: \n\nthread t1(findOdd, arg1, arg2) ",
