      "updated": 1765420997261,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now in Golang we do have wait group, \nit add one thread and wait for its done. \n\nSimilar in c++ , we do have join. \nthis will basically take take the thread name\nand join with main thread.\nso execution will once until threads\n\nsimilar to what wait group used to do with counts. ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now in Golang we do have wait group, \nit add one thread and wait for its done. \n\nSimilar in c++ , we do have join. \nthis will basically take take the thread name\nand join with main thread.\nso execution will once until threads\n\nsimilar to what wait group used to do with counts. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
